<title>CHINA: Albatronics yearly net returns to profit.</title>
<headline>Albatronics yearly net returns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.4 gain   vs 21.7 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  11.15 loss vs 31.37 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    10.75 gain vs 43.44 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,515.04   vs 2,118.99</p>
<p>    Company name		 Albatronics (Far East) Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 15-19</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Albatronics (Far East) is a supplier of audio components to SONY. Exceptional items represent loss mainly from provision for bad debt, provision for obsolete and slow moving stocks, and provision for permanent diminution in value of a long-term investment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
